    ],
    "text": "2\u2014PL 006894\u2014 850 (01/2013)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      183.57,
      203.45,
      380.12,
      227.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE GLOBAL HUMANITARIANFOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      241.49,
      401.91,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cGlobalHumanitarian Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formed forthe purpose of effectually carrying out and transacting allobjects and matters connected with the said Associationaccording to the rules agreed to by its Directors:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      317.69,
      401.87,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Association has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      368.45,
      401.88,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      406.61,
      401.87,
      430.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as The Global HumanitarianFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      444.65,
      401.92,
      570.35
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cGlobal Humanitarian Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as\u201cthe Foundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of the \u201cGlobalHumanitarian Foundation\u201d and by that name may sue and besued in all Courts, with full power and authority to have, anduse a common seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      584.33,
      401.87,
      608.39
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      622.49,
      401.91,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(a) the development of acquaintance as an opportunityfor service taking an active interest in the Civic,Economical, Educational, Religious Cultural, Socialand Moral Welfare of the community;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      241.51,
      442.29,
      250.58
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      409.03,
      443.86,
      418.1
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      444.67,
      455.86,
      482.54
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof the GlobalHumanitarianFoundation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      586.15,
      455.14,
      614.42
    ],
